@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "FralseCont";
}
<!-- Firma: FRANCO LARA - 10/07/2026 | Reorganiza la portada publica para mostrar primero una landing SaaS de FralseCont con tres planes de suscripcion y accesos al registro por plan, ajusta el branding visible a Sistema Contable con Fralse y Cont en dos colores y elimina la tarjeta informativa redundante. -->
<!-- Firma: FRANCO LARA - 14/07/2026 | Resume la vista publica de planes para mostrar a primera vista los diferenciales clave de Gratis, Emprendedor y Contador, unifica beneficios base entre Emprendedor y Contador y deja la validacion CPE solo en Contador con un bloque expandible Ver detalle. -->
<!-- Firma: FRANCO LARA - 25/07/2026 | Cambia el nombre visible del plan Gratis a Prueba en la vista publica, conservando su vigencia de 30 dias. -->

<section class="nubecont-pricing-section" aria-labelledby="nubecont-pricing-title">
    <div class="nubecont-pricing-container">
        <header class="nubecont-pricing-header">
            <span class="nubecont-brand-kicker">Sistema Contable</span>
            <h1 id="nubecont-pricing-title" class="nubecont-brand-title"><span>Fralse</span><span class="nubecont-brand-accent">Cont</span></h1>
            <p class="nubecont-brand-subtitle">Sistema contable web para empresas y contadores</p>
            <p class="nubecont-brand-description">Powered by Fralse Tech S.A.C.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="nubecont-plans-grid">
            <article class="nubecont-plan-card nubecont-plan-card--free">
                <header class="nubecont-plan-top">
                    <h2 class="nubecont-plan-name">Prueba</h2>
                </header>

                <div class="nubecont-plan-price-block">
                    <div class="nubecont-plan-price-row">
                        <span class="nubecont-plan-currency">S/</span>
                        <span class="nubecont-plan-price">0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="nubecont-plan-period">por 30 dias</div>
                </div>

                <p class="nubecont-plan-description">
                    Prueba FralseCont y conoce las funciones esenciales de nuestra plataforma contable.
                </p>

                <a class="nubecont-plan-button nubecont-plan-button--free"
                   asp-area="Identity"
                   asp-page="/Account/Register"
                   asp-route-plan="GRATIS">
                    Comenzar gratis
                </a>

                <hr class="nubecont-plan-divider" />

                <ul class="nubecont-plan-features">
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>1 empresa.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>1 usuario.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Vigencia de 30 dias.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Compras y ventas.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Registros limitados.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Asientos contables limitados.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Reportes contables base.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Tipo de cambio manual.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature nubecont-plan-feature--unavailable"><i class="bi bi-dash-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Sin consulta de RUC y DNI en linea.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature nubecont-plan-feature--unavailable"><i class="bi bi-dash-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Sin tipo de cambio en linea.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature nubecont-plan-feature--unavailable"><i class="bi bi-dash-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Sin validacion CPE.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature nubecont-plan-feature--unavailable"><i class="bi bi-dash-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Sin empresas adicionales.</span></li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <article class="nubecont-plan-card nubecont-plan-card--entrepreneur">
                <header class="nubecont-plan-top">
                    <h2 class="nubecont-plan-name">Emprendedor</h2>
                    <span class="nubecont-plan-badge nubecont-plan-badge--soft">Mas elegido</span>
