                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Asientos manuales y automaticos.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Tipo de cambio oficial en linea.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Sincronizacion mensual de tipos de cambio.</span></li>
                    <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Consulta de RUC y DNI en linea.</span></li>
                </ul>

                <details class="nubecont-plan-details">
                    <summary>Ver detalle</summary>
                    <ul class="nubecont-plan-features">
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Caja y Bancos.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Cuentas corrientes.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Transferencias entre cuentas.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Pagos y cobros parciales.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Aplicacion de notas de credito.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Control de saldos pendientes.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Detracciones, percepciones y retenciones.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Centros de costo y cuentas destino.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Configuracion contable completa.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Cierre y reapertura de periodos.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Diferencia en cambio y ajuste de cuentas.</span></li>
