                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Reportes contables completos y PLE.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Copia de plan contable desde empresa base.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Tipo de cambio manual.</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </details>
