                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Libros electronicos PLE e historial de archivos.</span></li>
                        <li class="nubecont-plan-feature"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle nubecont-plan-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Reportes por empresa y soporte prioritario.</span></li>
